run - timeline rendering (the trace of a run to t = 2)

box.modes
  0 .. 1  waiting | waiting
  1 .. 2  done | waiting (time)  (held at the end)
  transitions:
    t=1 waiting -> done (time)
  noted:
    t=0 choice entering open: next left.waiting(entry), right.waiting(entry) (unordered; took left.waiting(entry) first)
